# NAGARNAVI — environment variables
#
# NAGARNAVI deliberately requires NO API keys or secrets for its core
# experience. All external data comes from public, keyless providers that are
# proxied through the app's own server (see custom-routes.ts):
#
#   - OpenStreetMap / Photon  → city & place search, geocoding
#   - OpenStreetMap (Nominatim) → category place discovery (secondary)
#   - Wikipedia (REST + MediaWiki API) → sourced heritage/culture + notable places
#   - Open-Meteo              → live weather & forecast
#
# Because everything is keyless, this file is intentionally empty of secrets.
# Copy it to `.env` only if you need to override something.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL — provided automatically by the Shogo runtime in a managed pod.
# Do not hardcode these; they are injected by the platform.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SHOGO_API_URL=
# PROJECT_ID=
# RUNTIME_AUTH_SECRET=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTIONAL overrides (all have sensible defaults)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PORT=3001                 # port for the Hono API + static server (server.tsx)
# DATABASE_URL=file:./prisma/dev.db
